    XEQ 25                      ; -> :HUMAN:
  ELSE 01
    XEQ 28                      ; -> :C47MV:
  ENDIF 01
  82
  RCL 98
  X≠Y?
WHILE 01
ENDDO 01
20.79                           ; ---- the end: R20-R99 cleared (R-CLR 20.79: 20 + 79 stays below 100, a count 0 is refused; then R99), the matrices deleted, WSIZE 64, GRMOD 0, GRFNT 20, the screen; your stack back ----
